type)\n    -   [Add to Search](#)\n    \n-   Saccharomyces cerevisiae / genetics\n    \n    Actions\n    \n    -   [Search in PubMed](/?term=%22Saccharomyces+cerevisiae%2Fgenetics%22%5BMeSH%5D&sort=date&sort_order=desc)\n    -   [Search in MeSH](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/mesh?term=Saccharomyces+cerevisiae)\n    -   [Add to Search](#)\n    \n\n## Substances\n\n-   Chromosomal Proteins, Non-Histone\n    \n    Actions\n    \n    -   [Search in PubMed](/?term=%22Chromosomal+Proteins%2C+Non-Histone%22%5Bnm%5D&sort=date&sort_order=desc)\n    -   [Search in MeSH](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/mesh?term=%22Chromosomal+Proteins%2C+Non-Histone%22)\n    -   [Add to Search](#)\n    \n\n## Supplementary concepts\n\n-   Meier-Gorlin syndrome\n    \n    Actions\n    \n    -   [Search in PubMed](/?term=%22Meier-Gorlin+syndrome%22%5Bnm%5D&sort=date&sort_order=desc)\n    -   [Search in MeSH](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/mesh?term=Meier-Gorlin+syndrome)\n    -   [Add to Search](#)\n    \n\n## Grants and funding\n\n-   [#PJT 159683/CAPMC/ CIHR/Canada](/?term=%23PJT+159683%2FCAPMC%2F+CIHR%2FCanada%5BGrants+and+Funding%5D&sort=date&sort_order=desc \"All articles for grant #PJT 159683/CAPMC/ CIHR/Canada\")\n-   [RGPIN-2019-05082/Natural Sciences and Engineering Research Council of Canada](/?term=RGPIN-2019-05082%2FNatural+Sciences+and+Engineering+Research+Council+of+Canada%5BGrants+and+Funding%5D&sort=date&sort_order=desc \"All articles for grant RGPIN-2019-05082/Natural Sciences and Engineering Research Council of Canada\")\n-   [Fonds de recherche du Québec - Santé (FRQS)](/?term=Fonds+de+recherche+du+Qu%C3%A9bec+-+Sant%C3%A9+%28FRQS%29%5BGrants+and+Funding%5D&sort=date&sort_order=desc \"All articles for grant Fonds de recherche du Québec - Santé (FRQS)\")\n-   [#PJT 159683/CAPMC/ CIHR/Canada](/?term=%23PJT+159683%2FCAPMC%2F+CIHR%2FCanada%5BGrants+and+Funding%5D&sort=date&sort_order=desc \"All articles for grant #PJT 159683/CAPMC/ CIHR/Canada\")\n\n## LinkOut - more resources\n\n-   #